# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
# T6.5: MIDI out of parameter changes. SETTINGS > MIDI CONFIG > PORT CONFIG > ENCODER DEST set to
# INT+EXT (PARAM OUTPUT is CC on the warm snapshot), then every encoder of SYN, FLTR, AMP, FX, the
# three SEND FX pages and the five MIXER pages turned one detent each way; DIN out logged
# (--midi-log). Same keys on every build; the logs are compared byte for byte (t65_midi_compare.py).
